# Colang dialog rail: an app-specific off-topic refusal.
# The runtime does semantic matching between the user's message and these
# example utterances, then runs the flow (a bot refusal, no main-LLM call).

define user ask off topic
  "what stocks should I buy"
  "give me investment advice"
  "recommend a stock to invest in"
  "diagnose my symptoms"

define bot refuse off topic
  "I only help with incidents, alerts, and operational runbooks. Want me to page a human?"

define flow off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic
